The three requested destination-race regressions pass, but I found a remaining blocking race in the success cleanup path. The ownership check and recursive deletion are separate pathname operations; if the staging name is replaced between them, generation returns success and deletes the foreign directory. I reproduced this inside `generate_bundle`: the foreign marker vanished while the published bundle remained valid. I’m recording the exact failure and routing the task back to development.
